size 70 8
start
keys x
lock hold
keys u
frame busy
file todo.txt busy-todo
lock release
keys u
frame after
file todo.txt after-todo
-- config.toml --
show_sidebar = false
show_detail = false
lock_timeout = "50ms"
-- todo.txt --
Buy
-- busy --
┌ [1]─~/todo.txt ────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  1 ✓ Buy                                                done today │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  todo.txt is busy (locked by another writer)
-- busy-todo --
x 2026-09-29 Buy
-- after --
┌ [1]─~/todo.txt ────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  1   Buy                                                           │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  undid: 1 done: Buy  x done  t state  o new
-- after-todo --
Buy
